id: combat-illusion
name: Combat Illusion
advancement: true
prerequisite: 4+ Bluff Skill Ranks
tpCost: 6
# "Any Opponent who loses the Clash for the effects of Illusion also gains the Guard Down Combat Condition for the
# duration of its effects" - beside the 1d4's, until the end of your next turn.
illusionGuardDown: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Every Opponent who loses Illusion's Clash is also Guard Down for as long.
text: >
  Combat Illusion: Your illusions are incredibly realistic and your opponent is easily duped by them making any kind of
  aggressive motion!
  –Prerequisites: 4+ Bluff Skill Ranks
  –TP Cost: 6
  –Effect: Any Opponent who loses the Clash for the effects of Illusion also gains the Guard Down Combat Condition for
  the duration of its effects.
